    intro: 'A property photographer in Comporta is working in one of the highest-value second-home markets in the country, and the listings show it: low white houses under thatch, rooms opening onto pine gardens, pools looking out over the paddies. Buyers and holiday renters weigh these places carefully, very often from another country, and the photographs carry most of that weighing. The task is to show the house as it is at the hour its rooms are at their best, without inflating them. Thirty minutes covers one property, interiors first, and the edited files are with you within {delivery}, ready for the agency or the booking platform.',
